	"descriptionMarkdown": "Designed for non-stop travel between Nauvis-Fulgora-Aquilo.\n- only common quality\n- ~250 km/s for non-stop-flight, ~300 km/s with buffering\n- designed for projectile and explosive damage 7 and asteroid productivity 0\n- self sufficient (except for nuclear fuel cells)\n- 6 cargo bays\n- 506 tons\n- start when 3 lights on the left are on\n\nammo production inspired by:\nhttps://factorioprints.com/view/-ODqrNrGx-KPdRw50b65\n\nUpdate June 26:\n- solar cells are incorporated, no need for start up platform\n- while low on steam, foundry production is stopped so that grabbers can work at full capacity, reducing start up time\n- calcite can be supplied externally, further reducing startup time\n- increased cargo bays to 12, so that 15 rockets can be send at a time, ship is a little larger now\n- thruster only supplied with fuel, if you have enough ammo -> you should be able to send it to gleba/fulgora right after building. Will depart as soon as ready.",
